# BILLING_TRIAL_DAYS_DEFAULT=30
# BILLING_CURRENCY=INR
# BILLING_PAYMENT_ADAPTER=payment-sbiepay
#   Read from EOS settings (eos_core.settings.payment_adapter). `none` (the default, and what deploy-api-lxc.sh
#   writes): no online payment. Outside dev mode a paid plan is then never self-service: POST /subscription/upgrade
#   answers 409 payment_not_configured and a super admin activates it once paid (PUT /admin/subscriptions/{id}).
#   POST /webhooks/payment answers 404.
# BILLING_PAYMENT_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
#   The key the adapter signs POST /webhooks/payment with (HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body, hex, X-Payment-Signature).
#   For payment-sbiepay: the same value as PAYMENT_SBIEPAY_NOTIFY_SECRET. Empty: every notification is refused (503).
# BILLING_TRIAL_REMINDER_DAYS=7,3,1
# GST tax invoices. Without BILLING_SUPPLIER_GSTIN invoices are issued without tax (development and pilots).
# BILLING_SUPPLIER_GSTIN=
# BILLING_SUPPLIER_NAME=
# BILLING_SUPPLIER_ADDRESS=
# BILLING_GST_RATE=18
# BILLING_SAC_CODE=998315
# BILLING_INVOICE_PREFIX=EOS      # at most 3 characters: PREFIX/26-27/000001 stays within 16
